NepDate for Zig

This repository ports NepDate, the C# library by Raju Prasai and contributors
(https://github.com/RajuPrasai/NepDate), to Zig. The calendar and patro data, the golden test
vectors and the behaviour this port follows all come from that library.

The core and the patro are compiled from the C amalgamation of the NepDate C port
(https://github.com/sanamhub/nepdate-c, tag v0.2.0-rc.1, commit
77af203878acf290f5024b249e8b31b67a38dc69), which is itself a port of the same C# original. The
vendored files are listed in vendor/nepdate-c/SHA256SUMS and checked by tools/check_vendor.py.

The calendar data in shared/data (data/calendar/, data/patro/) was extracted from
NepDate (https://github.com/RajuPrasai/NepDate, commit c6fff4f2f60ac01e31c086568320649627422ba1)
